    <statement><p>What is the coefficient of <m>x^{11}</m> in the expansion of <m>(x+3)^{16} + x^3(x+5)^{20}\text{?}</m></p>
<p><fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>3^{5}\mathop{\rm C}\nolimits\mathopen{}\left(16,11\right)+5^{12}\mathop{\rm C}\nolimits\mathopen{}\left(20,8\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p><m>3^{5}\cdot{16 \choose 11} + 5^{12}\cdot{20 \choose 8}\text{.}</m></p>
</solution>
